A $2.1 billion fund just moved into T-bills. Onchain.

@circle moved the fund behind USYC out of overnight reverse repo and into U.S. Treasury bills of up to six months. Same token. Same issuer. Same USDC in, USDC out.

Why it matters: USYC is the yield-bearing collateral big https://t.co/x8XvRsKxJN
